      "renderedContent": "<div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-8 md:px-20 mb-32 space-y-48 md:space-y-64\">\n    <!-- Detail 01: Vision -->\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-16 md:gap-24 reveal\">\n        <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-8\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest-xl uppercase\">The Process</div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-heading text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-ultra-tight uppercase leading-none\">THE VISION</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-lg md:text-xl font-light\">Traditional animation is slow. Our goal was to build a tool that allows artists to prompt movement directly onto their character sheets, reducing production time by 70% while maintaining the \"human touch\" of hand-drawn frames.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"project-arrow w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-700 hover:rotate-45 hover:bg-black hover:text-white dark:hover:bg-white dark:hover:text-black\">\n                <svg class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-[1.5] w-full\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-video rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-gray-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 group\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550745165-9bc0b252726f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" alt=\"Vision Detail\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1.5s] group-hover:scale-105\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Detail 02: Execution -->\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-16 md:gap-24 reveal\">\n        <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-8 md:text-right md:items-end flex flex-col\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest-xl uppercase\">The Result</div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-heading text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-ultra-tight uppercase leading-none\">THE EXECUTION</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-lg md:text-xl font-light\">We iterated through 45 custom neural network models to find the perfect balance between style consistency and temporal coherence. The final result is a hybrid engine that respects the artist's original line weights.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"project-arrow w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-700 hover:rotate-45 hover:bg-black hover:text-white dark:hover:bg-white dark:hover:text-black\">\n                <svg class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-[1.5] w-full\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-video rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-gray-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 group\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558655146-d09347e92766?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" alt=\"Execution Detail\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1.5s] group-hover:scale-105\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
